# PAL SGL DECOMPILER — EXEC TREE BUILDER
# v80p mars specialized PHI root-pathway rewrite + v80o PHI-demand unlock/generation commit + v80n PHI-ticket finalization + v80m PHI-conservation transport-route alignment + v80l PHI transition conservation + v80k semantic-region transition transport + v80j resolved-record precedence + v80i resolved fixed-record indexing + v80h equal-cardinality capacity fallback + v80g statusless v37 binding recognition + v80f partial semantic-PHI admission + v80e path-expanded capacity + v80d identity-candidate transport + v80c mars state-flow audit ledger partition + v80b exact-control-edge occurrence authority + v80 semantic-capability/typed-owner closure + v79 residual-PHI/typed-edge bridge + v78 occurrence-obligation closure + v77 consumer-key projection + v76 occurrence token handoff normalization + v75 occurrence authority + v74 state-flow structural handoff + v73 ingenious-emperor exact loop-edge role custody + v72 clothed-emperor fail-closed EdgeTruth consumption + v71 cook-emperor typed direct-join owner alignment + v70 empty-arm ownership + v69 direct-join custody + v68 snapshot rebinding + v67 derived-value boundary custody
# Preserves v55 payload, v56 terminal, v57 multiway, v58 condition, v59 loop, v60 frontier, v61 traversal, v64 exact-consumer compatibility, and v65 raw-operand evidence
# ============================================================================
#
# Goal:
#   Preserve the stable structure of the original PALSGLdecomp.py while fixing
#   branch-polarity mistakes discovered in complex GCC/O0 lowered code.
#
# What this iteration deliberately does NOT do:
#   - no broad branch-local duplication
#   - no linear fallback rewrite
#   - no attempt to recover pretty source structure
#   - no switch-to-match recovery
#
# v80p specialized pathway rewrite:
#   - bypasses the v79/v80 admission queue for an incomplete ordinary PHI whose
#     predecessor domain and source map can be proven uniquely from root PHI,
#     CFG, loop-region, and v37 evidence;
#   - materializes the exact source ticket before state-flow handoff freezing;
#   - requires one exact edge epoch, placement receipt, authorized placement,
#     and consumer-plan obligation or fails inside SGL.
#
# v80o transaction repair:
#   - imports exact v37 canonical PHI transition demand before v79/v80 source gating;
#   - rejects vacuous zero-repair success when a non-empty demand surface exists;
#   - audits every admitted demand through edge epoch, placement, and consumer obligation;
#   - commits state-flow and occurrence aliases as one object-identical generation.
#
# v80n transaction repair:
#   - selects the semantic predecessor ticket domain before conservation gating;
#   - admits the exact v37 contract set when it matches PHI input cardinality;
#   - prevents literal CFG predecessor projection from excluding semantic-region tickets;
#   - audits repaired ticket -> accepted edge epoch -> accepted placement -> consumer obligation.
#
# v80m transaction repair:
#   - aligns v80l conservation admission with v80k transport authority;
#   - accepts either one literal CFG edge or one unique semantic-region route;
#   - preserves the semantic PHI token while carrying the physical loop-exit edge separately;
#   - audits repaired transition -> accepted edge epoch -> terminal placement conservation.
#
# v80c transaction repair:
#   - partitions resolved-record precedence observations from material record audits;
#   - proves exact receipt-key equality instead of count-only coverage;
#   - rejects null, duplicate, missing, extra, kind-mismatched, or status-mismatched audit receipts.
#
# v80b transaction repair:
#   - authorizes an accepted ordinary edge from one exact unique if/loop-condition occurrence;
#   - rejects ambiguous controls, non-successors, cases, direct joins, and loop-special edges;
#   - audits accepted edge-epoch and authority receipt keys by exact set equality;
#   - publishes non-terminal raw-SID source-binding obligations for PHIfolder/ABI consumers.
#
# v80 transaction repair:
#   - publishes a behavior-capability receipt, not merely a version label;
#   - resolves typed direct-join loop-exit owners by exact edge, path, node identity, then predecessor occurrence;
#   - publishes one consumer plan obligation for every accepted occurrence authority receipt;
#   - keeps branch, loop, direct-join, payload, return, expression, and visited heuristics unchanged.
#
# v79 transaction repair:
#   - limits late-PHI closure to residual obligations not already owned by SemanticGraph;
#   - gives resolved v37 records precedence over duplicate unresolved observations;
#   - projects exact v71 typed direct-join owners into authorized edge occurrences;
#   - retains non-terminal case references with legacy placement/occurrence aliases.
#
# v78 transaction base:
#   - closes late/sparse raw MULTIEQUAL obligations by exact defining-block evidence;
#   - authorizes existing path-local structural edge containers only when no predecessor ExecBlock exists;
#   - publishes case evidence as non-terminal references to one canonical placement;
#   - audits exact accepted-edge set difference and one terminal envelope per placement key;
#   - preserves v77 producer/consumer identity projection and all CFG/ExecTree heuristics.
#
# v77 transaction base:
#   - preserves SemanticGraph producer transition tokens verbatim;
#   - projects a canonical PALPHIfolder-facing consumer key;
#   - audits producer/consumer first-four equivalence and placement identity;
#   - leaves CFG, branch, loop, direct-join, case, and occurrence heuristics unchanged.
#
# What this iteration does:
#   - retains original traversal/visited behavior
#   - selects then/else using CFG true/false edges as baseline
#   - applies narrow polarity repairs for observed lowered patterns:
#       * if cond: pass / else: action  -> swap action under cond
#       * const < var skip-tests        -> swap
#       * switch compare/range chains   -> targeted swaps
#       * check_bit == 0 path           -> corrected action polarity
#       * parity ternary call pair      -> corrected even/odd selection
#   - emits branch diagnostics
#   - proves condition-only temporary dependency cones before suppressing payload
#   - records independent direct/composite condition provenance and audits it
#   - consumes SemanticGraph v35 erase-emperor temporal snapshot contracts
#   - stops protected COPY outputs from being inlined into later PHI epochs
#   - refreshes stale authoritative EdgeTruth text from snapshot-aware live formula identity
#   - fails closed if a protected snapshot and later epoch render identically
#   - preserves unresolved canonical EdgeTruth as tri-state
#   - forbids legacy condition fallback after a canonical unresolved verdict
#   - requires complementary authoritative truth for both binary successors
#
# This is meant as a safer path from the last stable structured output.
# ============================================================================

